WEBVTT

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.420
What's wrong, Captain?
Why are you stopping?

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:24.040
Captain?

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.920
Can... you see it?

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:31.140
D-Dwelling within...
us survivors and orphans...

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.510
Th-The deep-seated...

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.390
...grudge of Ba-Battle of Chouhei?

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:40.270
The g-grudge... of Battle of Chouhei?

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.900
B-But I don't...

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.980
Can <i>you </i>see it, sir?

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.200
Battle of Chouhei...

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.030
Ain't that where that
huge massacre went down?

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.120
Who cares?

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.250
That happened before I was even born!

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.960
This here is a battlefield!

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.170
And mid-battle is no place

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.170
for your bullshit!

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:46.560
A Wasteland Riddled with Holes

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:54.740
Huh?

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.860
It... It's you!

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:59.030
Oh, thank goodness...

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.160
He's finally dead.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:04.200
Damn... these guys can take a beating!

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.620
This way!

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:08.960
Bad news, Bi Hei--
there's more of them every minute!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.420
What?!

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.710
Kill them!

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.880
I-It's no use. Run--

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.180
Take <i>that</i>!

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:18.760
Den Yuu!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.220
Commander Den Yuu!

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:25.060
Thanks! And good job finding us!

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.560
Wasn't me.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:27.730
Huh?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.520
Thank goodness!

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.030
I'm glad Den Yuu ran
into you way out here.

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:34.440
Ka Ryo Ten!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.780
All the wounded, meet in the center.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:40.700
Bi Hei, Taku Kei,
your unit will cover this area.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.450
"Cover"?

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.750
Den Yuu, could you move
further into the middle?

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:46.960
On it!

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.040
Uh, what's...?

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.210
We're looking for our allies

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:53.090
by spreading out as we advance.

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:55.920
You're our tenth find.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.180
Advance <i>where</i>?

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.470
Where else?

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.260
To Shin, of course!

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:08.310
Are these main-camp troops
elites or something?

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.810
Th-They're all so tough!

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:21.450
I-If you do not know...
about Battle of Chouhei...

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:23.580
...I will educate you!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:29.750
N-Nineteen years ago...

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:34.800
...we, wh-who had been
de-defeated at Battle of Chouhei...

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.210
Storytime? Here? Now?

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:43.970
...l-laid down all our w-weapons
and surrendered.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.560
No... Wait. This...

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.730
This is an appeal--to the enemy troops!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:05:00.820
Th-They rounded up our 400 thousand
surrendered troops,

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.530
on a w-wasteland, riddled with

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:08.080
m-massive holes...

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.630
Father... Brother Gou...

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:22.890
Goku...

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:30.350
B-Burn this spectacle into your brain!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:33.310
It will be your last.

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:42.740
What?! So that man--he was <i>there</i>?

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:45.320
What's the meaning of all this?

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:50.000
And th-there...

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.040
...on the h-hill before us...

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:58.500
...stood H-Haku Ki,
one of Chin's Six Great Generals.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:02.010
Captain Man Gan, they can't mean...

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.260
Father...

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:08.600
Damn you, Haku Ki! Is this any way
to treat men who've surrendered?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:14.020
This atrocity will sully
your name for all of history!

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.310
That's right!

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:17.730
The heavens will never
forgive you for this!

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.820
A curse on your head!

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:21.110
Please, have mercy!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.400
There are children here!

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:24.860
Here, too!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.320
You'll never get away with this!

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:30.080
Never, you Chin dogs!

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:34.120
G-General, sir--please reconsider!

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.500
Sir...

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:41.670
Do it.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.170
Now!

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.880
Next!

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:50.720
Father...

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.770
Next!

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:54.230
Enough of this nonsense!

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.310
Get in there!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:05.150
M-Man... Goku... are you all right?

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.360
Cover them with that dirt!

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:11.990
Father?

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.330
This'll take till nightfall!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.540
Father... Goku!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.000
Brother Gou!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.630
Father!

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:26.800
Goku... Gou...

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.180
We're all together.

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:31.970
We die togeth--

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:36.560
We will be a grudge, a curse...

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:42.230
...to torment Chin for all eternity!

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:51.830
So he <i>dug himself </i>up out of the ground?!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:59.750
We... we have killed over
ten thousand Chin dogs so far.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.250
Th-That's not soldiers,

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:07.720
but ten thousand defenseless civilians!

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:08.680
What?!

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:14.060
But th-that is nowhere near 400 thousand!

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:17.140
W-We...

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:21.190
W-We are here...

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:25.900
...to annihilate every
Chin dog in Kanyou!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.570
That ain't happening!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.120
There! There he is!

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:35.540
Shin!

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:41.790
K-Kill them, orphans of Battle of Chouhei!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.710
B-Before we slaughter Kanyou,

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:49.970
drive these men d-deep into the earth!

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:51.140
Tch!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.850
They're all fired up again!

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:57.060
Cover each other's backs!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:00.850
"Hi"

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:01.770
Hi-yah!

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:02.810
Hah!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.640
"Hi"

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:05.570
Hi Shin Force, reporting!

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:09.150
Sorry for the wait, kiddo!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:12.990
Wow! You sure pulled together
in all this chaos!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.030
Shin!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.370
Ten!

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:18.700
You rode out into this? Are you nuts?!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:23.750
What's the point of
my becoming a tactician

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:27.460
if you all get yourselves killed
while I'm away?

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:32.630
Hai Rou, Ryuu Sen, Den Yuu,
Bi Hei: defend and support Shin!

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:36.720
Kyo Gai, Den Ei, Ryuu Yuu, Chu Tetsu:

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:40.060
deploy to the flanks to
block enemy reinforcements!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.440
Cavalry units, charge your enemy generals!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:47.980
All right!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.440
Not only have we regained
our numbers here,

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.400
but we can fight as a unit again!

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.070
We got this, Shou Sa!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.330
Shin?

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.000
"Sho" "Ri"

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.540
Ri Haku Army, Main Camp

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.590
Report!

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:11.670
An enemy unit has 
stormed Man Goku's army!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.380
They are now engaged in battle!

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.930
What?!

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:20.470
Has a Chin unit gotten its second wind?

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.730
Any generals requesting reinforcements?

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.730
Not in particular!

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:27.610
Send a thousand troops to Man Goku.

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:29.530
Ri Haku, sir?

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.190
Just in case.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:36.990
Though I doubt the Chin army can
best the power of Man Goku's grudge

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.910
when even his allies tremble before him.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.080
Shin! Quit spacing out on us!

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:50.550
That's right...

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.380
I knew it.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:55.510
There's no goin' back now.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:11:00.390
Tryin' to gloss over it all
ain't gonna do a thing.

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:03.060
Shin! What's wrong?

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.640
And that's why he...

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:09.060
Shin! Forget Man Goku's story
about Battle of Chouhei!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.530
It has nothing to do with us!

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:14.110
It's not like we were there!

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:18.410
Besides, this is no time
to worry about that!

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:21.200
Battle of Chouhei... Man Goku...

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.040
Man Goku!

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:29.000
Y-You do not fully understand.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:37.800
S-Someday, sometime, you too
will be caught up in this curse.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.970
Every last one of y-you...

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:44.680
Y-Your parents, your children...

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:51.150
We will bury... every last one of you...
in the depths of the earth!

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:53.280
S-Say <i>what</i>?!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:56.990
Damn him... spouting nonsense!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:03.870
Man Goku! I know about you!

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:04.830
Ka Ryo Ten?!

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:06.370
The lady tactician?

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:10.170
Your name is known throughout
the Chin army as a brutal general.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:13.300
You are on our watchlist!

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:16.550
You've invaded Chin territory
many times over

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:20.260
as you go around attempting
to kill every last civilian!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.550
Wha--?!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:26.180
I am only returning the f-favor.

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:30.310
The moment we surrendered,
we became noncombatants:

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:33.900
400 th-thousand civilians.

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:40.110
And you Chin d-dogs... you buried us alive!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:45.830
Don't make this out to be the same thing!

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.500
How on earth is this even similar?

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.830
Even if you did surrender at Battle of Chouhei,

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.250
you were soldiers right up to that point!

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:56.050
You can't <i>possibly </i>mean
to tell me the same is true

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.970
for all the people you've killed!

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:07.430
How <i>dare </i>you murder helpless women
and children, you bastard!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:09.350
Ka Ryo Ten...

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:13.560
What were those children's crimes?

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.690
What sins did those infants commit?

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:24.370
What did they know? Nothing!

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:28.040
Yet their lives were just...
snatched away.

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:33.130
You're the worst kind of maniac,
waging battles in the name of genocide

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:36.670
and calling it revenge for Battle of Chouhei!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:40.050
Shin! You don't need sympathy
for someone like that!

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:42.090
Take Man Goku down!

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:46.640
If he makes it to Kanyou,
they really will...

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.180
They'll be...

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.520
Shin! Look out!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.320
Forget all that fuss, Ten.

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:00.860
Shin!

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:04.820
I'm gonna take this guy down regardless.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:10.830
Good or evil, no one
gets away with killin' my men.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.330
But y'know...

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:17.710
We can stand to feel for this guy.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.170
Shin!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:22.300
People's emotions ain't
as simple as all that.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:24.050
Huh?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:27.010
It ain't like he's particularly
special or anything.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:30.680
There's gotta be others
like him out there.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:35.690
Hell, one wrong move and we might've
ended up like him ourselves.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:40.730
Once ya start thinkin' about that,
it just never ends.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.240
And I sure as hell don't have the answers.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:49.820
"Sho" "Chin"

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.660
No one does.

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:50.120
That's why we've been fighting--
for 500 years!

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:54.420
Exactly right, b-boy.

00:14:54.420 --> 00:15:01.050
Humans curse and kill one another for
eternity in a darkness with no way out.

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:04.170
No answers are to be found there.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:09.760
And th-that--<i>that </i>is
the truth of this world!

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:17.100
I used to think so, too, until recently.

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.860
Shin!

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.610
"Recently"?

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:24.490
I was a war orphan, too.

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:30.740
Not as messed up as Man Goku, but I
grew up figurin' war was a part of life.

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:36.750
Lived my life without even
questionin' <i>why </i>that was.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.840
But hearin' about this
guy's horrific behavior,

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:43.510
I started thinkin' maybe
there's an answer after all.

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:47.800
And it's kinda funny,
but I just now realized...

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.140
Huh?

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:54.810
The guy with the solution to this
whirlwind of wars with no way out--

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:57.560
turns out I know him.

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:01.980
Ain't that right, Ten?

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.730
Huh?

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:06.150
This is his solution:

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:10.450
Borders make an inside and
an outside. They make enemies.

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:14.200
National borders make separate
nations--and war rages on!

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:18.580
And that's why

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.840
he's bringin' the nations together!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:23.420
Sei!

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:27.970
And <i>I'm </i>his mighty sword!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:41.270
Sei's mighty sword--

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:43.360
Shin!

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.820
What's he talking about?

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:50.030
Bringing the nations to-together?

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:55.160
I don't care why you wanna go
to Kanyou, Man Goku--I ain't lettin' you!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:17:00.830
No way are we gonna let the people of
Kanyou and our king get slaughtered!

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.880
You rotten brat!

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:06.630
Man Goku!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.970
Stay with Shin!

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.840
Shin sure isn't hesitating anymore!

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:16.600
Their morale's back!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.310
Wretched cur!

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:21.850
Man Goku, sir, we should withdraw.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:25.150
What's the sense in being defeated
before we reach Kanyou?

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:28.900
More bloodthirsty units
are waiting behind us.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.070
Let <i>them </i>handle this!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:33.820
Fall back!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.240
"Sho" "Man"

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.490
Clear a path!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:37.240
What the--?

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.040
No! They're fleeing to
their allies in the back!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.790
Uh-oh! If we let them get away now,
we're done for!

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:44.670
It's all right!

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:45.710
Hoist the flags!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:46.670
"Hi"

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:47.920
"Man"

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:47.920
Huh?!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:54.260
"Hi"

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:51.050
A detached force?

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:53.680
Not a single one of them gets through!

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:56.800
So Sui!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.220
Lieutenant!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.690
Don't relax yet!
So Sui's unit isn't that big.

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:04.060
They can only hold off
the rear for so long!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.900
Th-This is Ka Ryo Ten's doing?

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:07.520
Sh-She's amazing!

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.980
Hurry, Shin!

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:13.110
This is where you finish off Man Goku!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.410
I got this, Chief!

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:16.660
There's the brat!

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.120
Outta my way!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:26.000
He's got more range than I expected!

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.130
His hands are longer than most.

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:29.420
Doesn't matter.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:33.510
Shin killed Rin Ko--he'd never
lose to someone like <i>this</i>!

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:38.720
Like that'll--

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.970
Huh?

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.390
Hey! Cut the bullsh--

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:52.990
Sh--!

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:59.490
Bring it on, you bastards!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:05.290
Y-You said that uniting our
nations would end wa-war.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:10.000
Do you th-think that's enough
to extinguish this?

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.840
Th-This grudge we hold...

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.220
...so deep within?

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:29.520
Father! Brother Gou!

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:40.990
Father... Brother Gou...

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:55.300
One g-grudge leads to another...

00:19:55.300 --> 00:20:02.310
Wi-Wipe out Kanyou and any survivors
will become the next Man Goku!

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:06.640
Thus the whirlpool of resentment
keeps on ch-churning...

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:11.690
And th-that is an established truth!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:15.490
Wrong! My family was killed--all of 'em!

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:18.990
But <i>I </i>didn't turn out like you!

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:24.160
You just didn't have anyone around
to pull you out of all that!

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:29.960
There's no "truth" about it!
You were just unlucky, that's all!

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:32.710
You're one miserable guy,

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:37.220
shoulderin' the burden
of all these awful ghosts.

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:41.800
You've been crushed under their weight!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.060
Don't you get it, Man Goku?

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:47.850
The one with the most
heinous curse is <i>you</i>!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:53.650
N-No! The curse is upon
all of hu-humanity!

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:57.780
Kill this accursed b-brat!

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:58.700
Shin!

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:01.740
You stone-cold <i>moron</i>!

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:04.200
I'll bear your pain for you!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:07.040
That way <i>you</i>...

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:10.080
...can rest in peace!

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:24.930
He...

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.720
He did it!

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:37.230
As a resident of Chin and a Chin commander,

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:40.610
I have only one thing to say to you:

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:44.660
I will <i>never </i>commit another Battle of Chouhei--

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:46.740
or allow one to happen!

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:56.670
I-I...

00:21:56.670 --> 00:22:01.630
I will become a grudge
m-myself... watching you.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:07.470
Wa-Watching what you do,
from the d-depths of the earth...

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:12.640
My eyes... always... on you...

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:17.230
Got it.

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:25.660
Meanwhile, Lord Hyou...

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:33.920
"Sho"

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:39.880
Hmph. The sun's set. Let's call it a day.

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:42.760
We'll end up fighting a night battle.

00:22:42.760 --> 00:22:48.260
Without proper preparations, forget
getting results--the risks are sky-high.

00:22:49.560 --> 00:22:50.810
We're heading back!

00:22:55.020 --> 00:22:57.900
Kei Sha, sir! Lord Hyou is retreating!

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:06.070
The same scene played out
on every battlefield.

00:23:07.870 --> 00:23:09.200
As dusk fell,

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:16.330
the long first day of the Battle of
Kankoku Pass came to an end at last.

00:24:52.510 --> 00:25:02.020
Ka Rin: A Spirited Woman

00:24:54.140 --> 00:24:58.810
Next time on Kingdom:
"Ka Rin: A Spirited Woman."
